  "id": "family-health",
  "name": "Family health",
  "description": "For keeping your family's health on track: kids' checkups by age, yearly physicals, dentist every 6 months, eye exams, flu shots, refills and insurance renewals, with doctors and appointments in one place. It isn't medical advice: follow your doctor's schedule. Pulse is a tracking aid, not your official record system.",
  "icon": "baby",
  "group": "Personal",
